UsageMesh 2.0.2 zero-touch update release.
- Every sync checks for a newer stable UsageMesh release.
- Stable updates are SHA-256 verified and installed in place.
- Workspace configuration, dashboard password, device identity and sync interval are preserved.
- New releases are staged as prereleases and only promoted to latest after all six platform builds and installer smoke tests pass.
- Fork Pages deployments build from the current upstream dashboard source and record build provenance.
